/P 87 0 R
/E (The Intake system underwent multiple development iterations: Initially we struggles to achieve a balance of rotational speed and torque, while the feeder experienced problems with inconsistent compression throughout as well as dead spots. The diverter also had its own problems allowing the intake of 2 or 4 artifacts. The most significant limiting factor was the limited intake size of previous designs.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
287 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 87 0 R
/E (Our intake iterated from a single 6000 rpm motor, to a coupled )
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
288 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 87 0 R
/E (1150 rpm design, and finally a single 1150 motor with a 5:7 ratio motor to optimize speed to torque ratio.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
