292 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 87 0 R
/E (The diverter was designed to meet several key requirements. Its length was optimized to fit within the robot while still creating a specified angle for the guided shooter, and its width was optimized to eliminate detrimental dead zones without slowing intake speed. A lofted gradient was also added to direct forces up and toward an intended path. Achieving this required many 3D iterations.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [9]
>>
