/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 90 0 R
/T (4 Autonomous Strategy We developed four autonomous routines for different starting positions on the field, allowing our robot to adapt based on alliance strategy and partner positioning. These routines are split between starting near the GOAL and starting in the back LAUNCH ZONE, each optimized for efficient pathing, fast cycling, and consistent scoring. By using smooth trajectories and coordinated intake/shooting sequences, each autonomous has the potential to score up to 12 ARTIFACTS while minimizing downtime and maximizing reliability.)
/E (4 Autonomous Strategy We developed four autonomous routines for different starting positions on the field, allowing our robot to adapt based on alliance strategy and partner positioning. These routines are split between starting near the GOAL and starting in the back LAUNCH ZONE, each optimized for efficient pathing, fast cycling, and consistent scoring. By using smooth trajectories and coordinated intake/shooting sequences, each autonomous has the potential to score up to 12 ARTIFACTS while minimizing downtime and maximizing reliability.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
