/S /H3
/P 90 0 R
/T (Our autonomous routine uses a 4-state Finite State Machine. The robot begins IDLE, then skips using the Limelight 3A to ALIGN to the target since the robot can just go to a preset point, SPINs UP the shooter to the calculated RPM, then LAUNCHes. This structure ensures each action only begins when the previous is complete, improving reliability.)
/E (Our autonomous routine uses a 4-state Finite State Machine. The robot begins IDLE, then skips using the Limelight 3A to ALIGN to the target since the robot can just go to a preset point, SPINs UP the shooter to the calculated RPM, then LAUNCHes. This structure ensures each action only begins when the previous is complete, improving reliability.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [12]
>>
