/E (Our programming lead began developing a physics-based shooter model as an alternative to empirical tuning. The model aimed to calculate required RPM from physics principles  using projectile motion, flywheel inertia, and game piece aerodynamics rather than collected data points. While the approach was theoretically more generalizable, it was not implemented this season due to the complexity of tuning the physical constants accurately within our timeline. The research paper is ongoing and available to view below.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [14]
>>
endobj
