/P 93 0 R
/E (Our entire robot is controlled through a Finite State Machine. Rather than running commands in sequence, the FSM defines discrete robot states and the conditions required to transition between them. This makes the code modular, easy to debug, and reliable under match pressure.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [3]
